#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:31
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrainersPokemonSpendTimeTogether"
msgid ""
"I think POKéMON get closer to their\n"
"TRAINERS if they spend time together.\p"
"The longer the better.\n"
"That's what I think.$"
msgstr ""
"我觉得宝可梦和训练家在一起的\n"
"时间越长，关系就会越亲密。\p"
"时间越长越好。我是这么想的。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HotSpringCanInvigorate"
msgid ""
"It's sort of magical how just sitting\n"
"in a hot-spring pool can invigorate.\p"
"I wish I could let my POKéMON\n"
"soak, too.$"
msgstr ""
"只是泡在温泉池里就能让人精神焕发，\n"
"真是有点神奇。\p"
"真希望也能让我的宝可梦泡一泡。$"

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:43
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_TrainersShouldRestToo"
msgid ""
"Hohoho! Hey, kid, you can reach\n"
"the hot springs from here.\p"
"If POKéMON are getting rest, so too\n"
"should their TRAINERS.$"
msgstr ""
"呵呵呵！嘿，小家伙，\n"
"从这里可以去温泉哦。\p"
"宝可梦在休息，\n"
"它们的训练家也应该好好休息才对。$"
